# Cilium's CNI plugin, from the Cilium agent image Giant Swarm runs (the
# gsoci mirror giantswarm/cilium-app deploys): the binary its
# install-cni-binaries init container copies into /opt/cni/bin, which IPE
# refuses to execute. The cni sysext cni_cilium-<release without v>.raw
# ships it as /usr/lib/cni/cilium-cni, and cni.extra/cilium adds what the
# chart's host-binary init containers would set up (images/README.md, CNI).
#
# An entry is a POSIX shell fragment that scripts/fetch-cni-plugins and the
# Makefile source; its file name is the CNI's name in the sysext version
# (<name>-<release without v>). It sets:
#   release  the image tag, the CNI's release
#   image    the image repository
#   digest   the digest of image:release (the multi-arch index); the plugins
#            come from its linux/amd64 image
#   plugins  the files of the image to install into /usr/lib/cni, each as
#            <path in the image>[:<name>]
# Renovate bumps release and digest together (renovate-custom.json5).
# renovate: datasource=docker
release=v1.20.5
image=gsoci.azurecr.io/giantswarm/cilium
digest=sha256:aa72499f075ad729947ea91b026218aceba24f1a8e4534bf36b8368c7c561526
plugins=opt/cni/bin/cilium-cni
